Cont…The Italian case provides a particularly instructive example. As far as is currently known, there is no evidence of a covert international operation behind Roberto Vannacci, but something politically more significant — and entirely visible — is taking place: the progressive integration of Futuro Nazionale into a transnational ecosystem of the new right. 

The political project now has private financial backers, organisational structures and a think tank, Rinascimento Nazionale; at the same time, it has contacts and channels of communication with circles associated with the Trumpian right. Benjamin Harnwell, Steve Bannon’s longstanding European associate, has publicly stated that he is in direct contact with Vannacci and keeps Bannon informed about developments in Vannacci’s political project.}

